{\textless}ul{\textgreater}
{{\textless}li{\textgreater}A} firm benefits from the labour market established by other firms{\textless}/li{\textgreater}
{{\textless}li{\textgreater}Several} firms using a free resource which is limited in supply {\textless}/li{\textgreater}
{\textless}li{\textgreater}cf. Ostrom: the examples he gives are definitely of the commons type - production changes from oil-well drilling of others; fisherman in the same waters; a public road and congestion problems...{\textless}/li{\textgreater}
