{{\textless}li{\textgreater}Successful} rules rewarded. {"As} long as the reward generated by the rule in period t-1 is greater than its strength at t-1, its strength will increase." [doesn't that penalise strength?] See his "evolving market structure" paper. {\textless}/li{\textgreater}
{{\textless}li{\textgreater}"As} a result, the strength of each rule converges to the weighted average of the rewards from the environment generated by that rule." [10]{\textless}/li{\textgreater}
